1373,"width":38,"height":39},{"text":"있습니다.","x":820,"y":1373,"width":148,"height":39}]},{"text":"그래프는 방향성이 있는 그래프와 방향성이 없는 그래프로 구분할 수 있습니다. 무방향 그래프","words":[{"text":"그래프는","x":220,"y":1465,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"방향성이","x":376,"y":1466,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"있는","x":536,"y":1466,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"그래프와","x":620,"y":1467,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"방향성이","x":780,"y":1466,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"없는","x":944,"y":1466,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"그래프로","x":1030,"y":1467,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"구분할","x":1189,"y":1466,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1313,"y":1467,"width":38,"height":38},{"text":"있습니다.","x":1369,"y":1466,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"무방향","x":1538,"y":1468,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"그래프","x":1658,"y":1468,"width":103,"height":35}]},{"text":"(undirectecl graph)는 에지가 양방향임을 의미합니다. 양방향이라 함은 대칭적인, 또는 상호 교환적","words":[{"text":"(undirectecl","x":222,"y":1543,"width":157,"height":33},{"text":"graph)는","x":393,"y":1544,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"에지가","x":536,"y":1542,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"양방향임을","x":653,"y":1541,"width":177,"height":40},{"text":"의미합니다.","x":842,"y":1541,"width":186,"height":39},{"text":"양방향이라","x":1047,"y":1541,"width":177,"height":39},{"text":"함은","x":1234,"y":1541,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"대칭적인,","x":1319,"y":1542,"width":148,"height":40},{"text":"또는","x":1484,"y":1544,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"상호","x":1567,"y":1542,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"교환적","x":1652,"y":1542,"width":104,"height":38}]},{"text":"인 속성을 나타냅니다. 도로망을 예로 들면, A와 B 장소 사이에 양방향 에지가 있다는 것은 A에","words":[{"text":"인","x":224,"y":1617,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"속성을","x":269,"y":1618,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"나타냅니다.","x":387,"y":1618,"width":181,"height":39},{"text":"도로망을","x":587,"y":1617,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"예로","x":744,"y":1617,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"들면,","x":826,"y":1617,"width":80,"height":39},{"text":"A와","x":923,"y":1616,"